    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/94ddbbecce3322ae4f40fc812c34b69b.avif?t=1753043826\" width=764 height=160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ODDCORE</strong> is a first person, retro-inspired boomer shooter with roguelike ingredients that is packed with endless, brain-rotting visuals of your bullets exploding everything they touch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL LAUNCH FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're still cooking, so try our FREE DEMO to get a taste!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOR NOW, IF THE ODDCORE IS CALLING YOUR NAME\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> please read the letter below, thank you\u00a0</strong>\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To YOU, YES YOU</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, looks like you are chosen to be <i>his</i> janitor! Here is the run down of the job:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are now an ODDCORE runner AND you have been employed to clean up our park one variant at a time in preparation for the coming holiday season. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy each run with new loadouts, manage time wisely and eradicate the corrupted hordes from taking over the ODDCORE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/49ab0676527b20b8a2929d9a8c7bd63e.poster.avif?t=1753043826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/49ab0676527b20b8a2929d9a8c7bd63e.webm?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/49ab0676527b20b8a2929d9a8c7bd63e.mp4?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u>EQUIP YOURSELF FOR DEPLOYMENT</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the ODDCORE with your own load-out, combining a variety of weapons and gadgets. Prove yourself to be the best among us.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/6112560958a147e58707f059409e776a.poster.avif?t=1753043826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/6112560958a147e58707f059409e776a.webm?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/6112560958a147e58707f059409e776a.mp4?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ERADICATE CORRUPTED ENTITIES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserving our memories one kill at a time. A bullet a day keeps the ODD away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/0ec639ad87d2238c75433020e32cf061.poster.avif?t=1753043826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/0ec639ad87d2238c75433020e32cf061.webm?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/0ec639ad87d2238c75433020e32cf061.mp4?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EJECT INTO NEW VARIANTS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somebody's gotta do the job! BEWARE, some variants can get odd...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/46415e70cffd5529e5d6bec6518e0340.poster.avif?t=1753043826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/46415e70cffd5529e5d6bec6518e0340.webm?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/46415e70cffd5529e5d6bec6518e0340.mp4?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ESCAPE?!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just kidding, you can take breaks though........ okay that's 10 seconds, GET BACK TO WORK!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the ODDCORE find favor upon you! Try doing a better job than the last guy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ODDBALL ODDIE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Warning!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing effects that may be unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</p>",
