ine poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/46415e70cffd5529e5d6bec6518e0340.poster.avif?t=1753043826\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/46415e70cffd5529e5d6bec6518e0340.webm?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/46415e70cffd5529e5d6bec6518e0340.mp4?t=1753043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ESCAPE?!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just kidding, you can take breaks though........ okay that's 10 seconds, GET BACK TO WORK!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the ODDCORE find favor upon you! Try doing a better job than the last guy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ODDBALL ODDIE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Warning!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing effects that may be unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</p>",
